       "source": "Luxembourg Times",
       "via": "Google News"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "France saw more than 600 arrests during student protests, with the interior minister describing the movement as spreading; demonstrations were reported in several cities.",
     "sources": [
      {
       "key": "a12e487f8e214449",
       "title": "Blocage des lycées : 625 interpellations mercredi, annonce le ministre de l’intérieur, qui constate une « extension du mouvement »",
       "url": "https://www.lemonde.fr/societe/article/2026/09/30/blocage-des-lycees-625-interpellations-mercredi-annonce-le-ministre-de-l-interieur-qui-constate-une-extension-du-mouvement_6786023_3225.html",
       "source": "Le Monde",
       "via": null
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "The UK is investigating possible Iranian involvement in a suspected plot targeting RAF Fairford, according to Prime Minister Andy Burnham.",
     "sources": [
      {
       "key": "9e6d9585ab0a4ce6",
       "title": "De « fortes indications » que l’Iran est impliqué dans le projet d’attaque contre une base militaire en Angleterre, selon le premier ministre britannique",
       "url": "https://www.lemonde.fr/international/article/2026/09/30/incident-pres-d-une-base-militaire-en-angleterre-de-fortes-indications-de-l-implication-de-l-iran-selon-le-premier-ministre-britannique_6786100_3210.html",
       "source": "Le Monde",
       "via": null
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "Emmanuel Macron welcomed the idea of the UK seeking to rejoin the EU, saying it would be good news for Britain and Europe.",
     "sources": [
      {
       "key": "d30207ca1c9d59d1",
       "title": "Macron says ‘welcome back’ to Burnham suggestion UK could rejoin EU",
       "url": "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/sep/30/macron-welcome-back-burnham-suggestion-uk-could-rejoin-eu",
       "source": "The Guardian World",
       "via": null
      }
     ]
    },
